    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7288" root="حد" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحَدُّ</span></b>  [<i>More,</i> and <i>most, sharp:</i> &amp;c.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  You say,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ مِنْ أَحَدِّ الرِّجَالِ</span> (tropical:)  <i>He is of the most sharp,</i> or
<i>hasty, in temper,</i> or <i>of the most irascible, passionate,</i> or <i>angry, of men.</i> (A, TA.)

